      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Against placebo background 50 patients with effort stenocardia received mildronate, a new native cardioactive drug and its effects on the clinical course in conditions of spirometric bicycle ergometry were studied. It was found that monotherapy with mildronate is accompanied by an antianginal effect and an increase of the physical working capacity of patients."},
